<title>SPAIN: Obrascon wins 918 mln pta Spanish contracts.</title>
<headline>Obrascon wins 918 mln pta Spanish contracts.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish contractor Obrascon said on Tuesday it has won three building contracts worth a total of 918 million pesetas.</p>
<p>The firm has contract in Malaga for 82 public residences for 262 million pesetas and contract in Seville for 99 residences worth 530 million pesetas.</p>
<p>Obrascon will also build a Shell service station in Malaga for 126 million pesetas.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
